      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01847",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“不要紧的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is all right.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01847",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "对我来说，黑夜和男人都是好的，没什么可怕。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "To me, night and men are both all right; there is nothing to be afraid of.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01847",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我不会让你送我的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will not let you see me home.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01847",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "再见！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Goodbye!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01847",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "她说着随随便便地把双手揣在怀里，就扬长而去。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As she said this, she casually tucked both hands into her robe and strode off.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
